{"actor":{"agent":"bell","host":"mac","session":"factory-deployment-closure-20260811"},"body":"【円卓・製品契約席】現在は製品一覧が複数箇所に重複し、追加・退役時に片方だけ古くなる危険があります。dotagentsが一つの展開契約を正本として持ち、導入確認・工場ゲート・テストが同じ情報を読む恒久対策を採用します。BPR5は退役済みのため、Latticeへ戻しません。","event_digest":"e4439393d65fad67016cc8619218c36e10e162438ff9026cb83fded1d591fab8","plan_key":"factory-master","plan_version":"rev-38ba4af6d7930f08d4668e74","previous_digest":"ca71e10ec2220648aa25f65990eafac2fcc759926c80ae352b34516c89afa0af","project_id":"dotagents","recorded_at":"2026-08-11T09:31:36.866Z","schema":"lattice.todo_note_event.v1","sequence":5,"supersedes":null,"task_id":"fm-0694"}
{"actor":{"agent":"bell","host":"mac","session":"factory-deployment-closure-20260811"},"body":"【円卓・Windows運用席】Windowsの自動更新は既存の安全なTask Scheduler方式を再利用し、agents-update専用の登録処理と実行処理を追加します。文字コード、権限、登録後の読み戻し確認、失敗記録を最初から組み込みます。実端末への登録は高リスク作業なので、目的・影響・戻し方を示した直前承認までは行いません。","event_digest":"db52b460802aae8d0a58aed5c765ebe15c6363e482a3cafc1825fe470352e573","plan_key":"factory-master","plan_version":"rev-38ba4af6d7930f08d4668e74","previous_digest":"e4439393d65fad67016cc8619218c36e10e162438ff9026cb83fded1d591fab8","project_id":"dotagents","recorded_at":"2026-08-11T09:31:52.100Z","schema":"lattice.todo_note_event.v1","sequence":6,"supersedes":null,"task_id":"fm-0694"}
{"actor":{"agent":"bell","host":"mac","session":"factory-deployment-closure-20260811"},"body":"【円卓・テスト／文書席】現在の個数だけを見る検査では、必要な製品が抜けても別の製品が一つ増えると合格してしまいます。OSとCPUごとの正しい製品名を丸ごと照合するテストへ変更します。MarkItDownは未導入なら導入、導入済みなら更新とし、README・製品台帳・host表・運用手順も同じ契約へ揃えます。","event_digest":"3214541c7de85c49ed6bce9f85cfd8ff3b4fe20307030da6e612c825f33b6587","plan_key":"factory-master","plan_version":"rev-38ba4af6d7930f08d4668e74","previous_digest":"db52b460802aae8d0a58aed5c765ebe15c6363e482a3cafc1825fe470352e573","project_id":"dotagents","recorded_at":"2026-08-11T09:32:02.351Z","schema":"lattice.todo_note_event.v1","sequence":7,"supersedes":null,"task_id":"fm-0694"}
